---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
const path='/privacy/';
---
<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy – LabelMetric" description="Privacy information for LabelMetric browser-based label printing calculators." canonicalPath={path}>
  <article class="narrow" style="padding:42px 0 64px"><h1>Privacy policy</h1><p><strong>Last updated:</strong> September 2026</p><p>LabelMetric's calculators are designed to run in your browser. Calculator values may be stored in your browser's localStorage so your recent inputs can be restored on the same device. That local storage is not a server account or database.</p><h2>Analytics</h2><p>The starter project does not include a third-party analytics script. If analytics, advertising or other third-party services are added later, this policy should be updated to accurately describe the data those services collect and the choices available to visitors.</p><h2>Contact</h2><p>Use the contact page for privacy questions. Replace all placeholder contact details before public launch.</p></article>
</BaseLayout>
